abstract: "Evidence snapshot comparing fixed recurrent-state precision masks under matched codecs and payloads. Some output-distribution gains were observed, but additional task-accuracy benefit and a reliable cost bound were not established. Includes CPU reconstruction tools and selected historical numerical code."
